 J8 fixture, gen_r_check with the L public values, R, anchor, replay and
 lane-map cases with a tail of PERM, SPONGE(5), DIGEST(SHK_REG); enc_wrap
 records the stock lane-map step, the ENC-2 log is not an R log)

